@ShowToastUI Text:第５章|#Toast_105|
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_26_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:走出审判庭，<br>艾玛长长地舒了一口气。|#0105Adv01_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:身旁的可可一脸沮丧。|#0105Adv01_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:吓死人了……搞不懂奈叶香怎么就死了，<br>还出现在那里……|#0105Adv01_Coco001| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1,ArmR3,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:不过对艾玛亲来说，倒是好事吧。<br>总算是捡回一条命了嘛。|#0105Adv01_Coco002| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0105Adv01_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（奈叶香被杀，怎么可能是好事……）|#0105Adv01_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（但我确实为了自己活下去，<br>　利用了奈叶香的死……）|#0105Adv01_Ema003|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——由于处刑台上出现了奈叶香的尸体，<br>艾玛以此为依据拼命说服了典狱长。|#0105Adv01_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她坚称，自己是重要证人，<br>在奈叶香被杀案真相大白之前<br>不应执行处刑。|#0105Adv01_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:于是，典狱长勉强同意再次举行魔女审判，<br>并额外允许短暂的调查。|#0105Adv01_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:直到下次审判开始，典狱长允许调查的时间<br>仅仅只有一小时。|#0105Adv01_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（留给我的时间，实在太少了……<br>　就算现在不被处刑，这样下去我也会……）|#0105Adv01_Ema004|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:内心的黑暗不断膨胀，<br>艾玛感到一阵强烈的眩晕。|#0105Adv01_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1,ArmR2,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:你看起来快撑不住了啊……<br>这样还能调查吗？|#0105Adv01_Coco003| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:……就算做不到也必须去做。|#0105Adv01_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1,ArmR2,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:唉……你这么拼命，<br>我陪着你拼命也很累啊。|#0105Adv01_Coco004| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（但又不能叫她不要跟着我……）|#0105Adv01_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:和可可一起行动<br>是有原因的。|#0105Adv01_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:因为这次是破格允许调查，<br>典狱长提出了一些限制条件。|#0105Adv01_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为了保全尸体证据，<br>要求两个人留在审判庭。|#0105Adv01_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而且，如果艾玛要外出调查，<br>必须有人陪同。|#0105Adv01_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:少女们在尴尬的气氛中简单商量后，<br>决定由玛格和梅露露留下来负责保全证据，<br>可可负责陪同艾玛调查。|#0105Adv01_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:时间不多了，<br>我们赶快开始调查吧。|#0105Adv01_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛快步走出，<br>可可一脸疲惫地跟在后面。|#0105Adv01_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1,ArmR1,ArmL1

; ＠備考◆気まずそうに

[PrintTextModified Text:……喂，如果你想逃跑，<br>我可会毫不留情地告诉典狱长哦。|#0105Adv01_Coco005| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（……可可一定认为，<br>　杀害亚里沙的凶手就是我，<br>　而且奈叶香也是我杀的……）|#0105Adv01_Ema008|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯，那样就好。|#0105Adv01_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛转过头回答道。<br>可可尴尬地移开了视线。|#0105Adv01_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（现在我身边已经没有任何人……）|#0105Adv01_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:从预感到所有人都会背弃自己，<br>让自己孤立无援的那一刻起。|#0105Adv01_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——艾玛的内心中，有什么在蠢蠢欲动。|#0105Adv01_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛用力摇了摇头，<br>努力追寻心中残存的光芒。<br>再次回想起至今为止，与那些少女们一同编织出的牵绊。|#0105Adv01_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（我并不是孤身一人）|#0105Adv01_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:深呼吸后，意识变得清晰，<br>能够坚定地直视前方了。|#0105Adv01_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这一次，<br>艾玛坚定地迈出了调查的脚步。|#0105Adv01_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

